// Call block(attempt) with attempt = 1, 2, ... up to `times` attempts.
// Return the first successful result. After a failure, call sleep(delay) before the next attempt:
// the first delay is initialDelayMs and each later delay doubles, capped at maxDelayMs.
// Do not sleep after the final attempt; rethrow its exception instead.
// Reject times < 1, initialDelayMs < 0, or maxDelayMs < initialDelayMs with IllegalArgumentException.
fun <T> retry(
